<div class="main-content row justify-content-center mt-3 mb-3">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <h1 class="text-center mb-4">Create Private Token</h1>
        {% include 'pages/create-token-material/templates/create-type-selector.html.twig' %}
        <h5 class="text-justify ti-4 lh-base">
            Create a private token and a data container.
            This operation is safe: your files will not be sent anywhere from your device.
            The data will be accessible only to you and no one else.
            Only the token minting transaction is sent to the blockchain.
            You can publish materials based on this token and the created file container at any time.
            Keep the file container and the private key of the token safe.
            They are a single entity that confirms your right to own digital data.
            Losing one of them means losing this confirmation.
        </h5>
        <div id="create-token-material" data-type="private-token"></div>
    </div>
</div>
